#. translators: Claude's own menu names (Customize, Connectors), as Claude shows them in your language.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:234
msgid ""
"in Claude, open Customize → Connectors, choose your site and click Connect"
msgstr "在 Claude 中打开 Customize → Connectors，选择您的网站并点击 Connect"

#. translators: %s: the MCP server name used in the setup command, e.g. example-com
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:237
#, php-format
msgid "in Claude Code, run /mcp, choose “%s” and pick Authenticate"
msgstr "在 Claude Code 中运行 /mcp，选择“%s”并点击 Authenticate"

#. translators: %s: a terminal command, e.g. codex mcp login example-com
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:239
#, php-format
msgid "run “%s” in your terminal"
msgstr "在终端中运行“%s”"

#. translators: Cursor's own menu names (Customize, MCPs, Reload, Authenticate), as Cursor shows them in your language. Verified with Cursor 3.24 on 2026-11-07.
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:241
msgid ""
"in Cursor, open Customize → MCPs, click your site, choose Reload, then click "
"Authenticate"
msgstr ""
"在 Cursor 中打开 Customize → MCPs，点击你的网站，选择 Reload，然后点击 "
"Authenticate"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:346
msgid ""
"This site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS address, so ChatGPT cannot "
"reach it from OpenAI's cloud. Use a terminal tool from the sidebar instead, "
"or set the WordPress Site Address to a tunnel or staging URL."
msgstr ""
"此站点似乎没有公网 HTTPS 地址，因此 ChatGPT 无法从 OpenAI 云端访问它。请改用"
"侧栏中的终端工具，或将 WordPress 站点地址设为隧道或预发布 URL。"

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Perplexity
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:350
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS address, so %s cannot "
"reach it from the vendor's cloud. Use a terminal tool from the sidebar "
"instead, or set the WordPress Site Address to a tunnel or staging URL."
msgstr ""
"此站点似乎没有公共 HTTPS 地址，因此 %s 无法从厂商云端访问它。请改用侧边栏中的"
"终端工具，或将 WordPress 站点地址设置为隧道或预发布 URL。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:352
msgid ""
"This site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS address, so the Claude "
"apps cannot reach it from Anthropic's cloud. Use a terminal tool or Claude "
"Desktop from the sidebar instead, or set the WordPress Site Address to a "
"tunnel or staging URL."
msgstr ""
"此站点似乎没有公网 HTTPS 地址，因此 Claude 应用无法从 Anthropic 云端访问它。"
"请改用侧栏中的终端工具或 Claude Desktop，或将 WordPress 站点地址设为隧道或预"
"发布 URL。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:363
msgid "Already added, or on a Team or Enterprise plan?"
msgstr "已经添加过，或使用 Team / Enterprise 套餐？"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:366
msgid ""
"Already added? Claude reports that a connector with this URL already exists. "
"Find it under <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong> and click "
"<strong>Connect</strong>."
msgstr ""
"已经添加过？Claude 会提示已存在使用此 URL 的连接器。请在 <strong>Customize → "
"Connectors</strong> 中找到它并点击 <strong>Connect</strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:367
msgid ""
"Custom connectors work on every Claude plan (Free is limited to one). On "
"Team and Enterprise, an organization owner adds the connector first under "
"<strong>Organization settings → Connectors</strong> (<strong>Add → Custom → "
"Web</strong>); members then click <strong>Connect</strong>."
msgstr ""
"所有 Claude 方案均可使用自定义连接器（Free 方案限一个）。在 Team 和 "
"Enterprise 中，需由组织所有者先在 <strong>Organization settings → "
"Connectors</strong>（<strong>Add → Custom → Web</strong>）中添加连接器，成员"
"随后点击 <strong>Connect</strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:369
msgid "Organization owner on Team or Enterprise?"
msgstr "您是 Team 或 Enterprise 的组织所有者？"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:370
msgid "Add it for your organization"
msgstr "为您的组织添加"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:385
msgid ""
"Site actually on a public HTTPS address? Use the cloud connector instead"
msgstr "站点其实有公网 HTTPS 地址？请改用云端连接器"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:415
msgid ""
"ChatGPT opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong>. Click "
"<strong>Approve</strong>. Back in ChatGPT, review the tools it found and "
"install the plugin, then start a new chat and type <strong>@</strong> and "
"its name."
msgstr ""
"ChatGPT 会打开<strong>您网站</strong>上的登录页面。点击 <strong>Approve</"
"strong>。回到 ChatGPT 后，查看发现的工具并安装该插件，然后开始新的聊天，输入 "
"<strong>@</strong> 和它的名称。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:416
msgid ""
"Claude opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong> (if it shows a "
"<strong>Connect</strong> button instead, click it). Click <strong>Approve</"
"strong>, then switch the connector on under <strong>+ → Connectors</strong> "
"in a chat."
msgstr ""
"Claude 会在<strong>您的站点</strong>上打开登录页面（如果显示的是 "
"<strong>Connect</strong> 按钮，请点击它）。点击<strong>批准</strong>，然后在"
"聊天中的 <strong>+ → 连接器</strong> 下开启该连接器。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:429
msgid "Add it to Claude"
msgstr "添加到 Claude"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:430
msgid "Add to Claude"
msgstr "添加到 Claude"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:434
msgid ""
"Opens claude.ai with this site filled in. Check the address, then click "
"<strong>Continue</strong> and <strong>Add</strong>. The connector shows up "
"in the Claude app too."
msgstr ""
"打开 claude.ai 并自动填入此站点。核对地址后，点击<strong>继续</strong>和"
"<strong>添加</strong>。该连接器也会出现在 Claude 应用中。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:435
msgid ""
"Opens claude.ai with this site filled in. Check the address, then click "
"<strong>Continue</strong> and <strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr ""
"打开 claude.ai 并自动填入此站点。核对地址后，点击<strong>继续</strong>和"
"<strong>添加</strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:440
msgid "Add it by hand instead"
msgstr "改为手动添加"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:448
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:506
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:645
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1171
msgid "Approve access"
msgstr "批准访问"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:457
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:624
msgid "Copy your connection link"
msgstr "复制您的连接链接"

#. translators: %s: a web address, e.g. chatgpt.com
#. translators: %s: a web address, e.g. grok.com/connectors
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:465
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:492
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:631
#, php-format
msgid "Go to %s"
msgstr "前往 %s"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:470
msgid "Sign in. Custom MCP servers work in ChatGPT on the web only."
msgstr "登录。自定义 MCP 服务器仅在网页版 ChatGPT 中可用。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:477
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:497
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:639
msgid "Paste the link"
msgstr "粘贴链接"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:480
msgid ""
"Go to <code>Plugins</code>, click <strong>Add</strong> (or <strong>+</"
"strong>) and choose <strong>Add custom MCP server</strong>."
msgstr ""
"前往 <code>Plugins</code>，点击 <strong>Add</strong>（或 <strong>+</"
"strong>），然后选择 <strong>Add custom MCP server</strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:482
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link as the <strong>Server URL</strong>, keep "
"Authentication on <strong>OAuth</strong>, tick the risk acknowledgement and "
"click <strong>Create as a plugin</strong>."
msgstr ""
"填写名称，将链接粘贴到 <strong>Server URL</strong>，认证方式保持 "
"<strong>OAuth</strong>，勾选风险确认，然后点击 <strong>Create as a plugin</"
"strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:485
msgid ""
"Only <strong>Create plugin</strong> and <strong>Upload plugin archive</"
"strong> in the menu? Your workspace has not given you the <strong>Create "
"plugins with MCPs</strong> permission; ask a workspace admin."
msgstr ""
"菜单中只有 <strong>Create plugin</strong> 和 <strong>Upload plugin archive</"
"strong>？说明您的工作区尚未授予您 <strong>Create plugins with MCPs</strong> "
"权限，请联系工作区管理员。"

#. translators: %s: a web address, e.g. claude.ai
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:492
msgid "Open the Claude app"
msgstr "打开 Claude 应用"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:511
msgid "Which ChatGPT plans work?"
msgstr "哪些 ChatGPT 套餐可用？"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:512
msgid ""
"Custom MCP servers work in ChatGPT on the web. A personal <strong>Plus</"
"strong> account can add and use one. In a <strong>Business, Enterprise or "
"Edu</strong> workspace you need the <strong>Create plugins with MCPs</"
"strong> permission: on Business only workspace admins and owners have it; on "
"Enterprise and Edu an admin grants it by role."
msgstr ""
"自定义 MCP 服务器可在网页版 ChatGPT 中使用。个人 <strong>Plus</strong> 账号即"
"可添加并使用。在 <strong>Business、Enterprise 或 Edu</strong> 工作区中，您需"
"要 <strong>Create plugins with MCPs</strong> 权限：在 Business 中只有工作区管"
"理员和所有者拥有该权限；在 Enterprise 和 Edu 中由管理员按角色授予。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:534
msgid ""
"Sign in, then open <strong>Plugins</strong> in the sidebar "
"(<strong>Customize → Connectors</strong> on accounts that do not have it "
"yet)."
msgstr ""
"登录，然后打开侧边栏中的 <strong>Plugins</strong>（尚未提供该入口的账户请打"
"开 <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong>）。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:535
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Add custom</strong> (<strong>+ Custom connector</strong> on "
"the older page), choose <strong>Add MCP connector</strong> and, if asked, "
"<strong>Remote</strong>. Give it a name, paste the link as the <strong>MCP "
"server URL</strong> (keep OAuth and Streamable HTTP), tick the "
"acknowledgement and click <strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr ""
"点击 <strong>Add custom</strong>（旧页面上为 <strong>+ Custom connector</"
"strong>），选择 <strong>Add MCP connector</strong>，如有询问再选择 "
"<strong>Remote</strong>。输入名称，将链接粘贴为 <strong>MCP server URL</"
"strong>（保留 OAuth 和 Streamable HTTP），勾选确认项，然后点击 <strong>Add</"
"strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:536
msgid ""
"Click the new connector’s card (then <strong>Add connector</strong> if it "
"asks) — Perplexity opens the sign-in in a popup."
msgstr ""
"点击新连接器的卡片（如有提示再点击 <strong>Add connector</strong>），"
"Perplexity 会在弹出窗口中打开登录页。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:537
msgid ""
"<strong>Needs Perplexity Pro, Max or Enterprise.</strong> The free plan has "
"no custom connectors."
msgstr ""
"<strong>需要 Perplexity Pro、Max 或 Enterprise。</strong>免费方案没有自定义连"
"接器。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:538
msgid ""
"Verified on Pro (2026-10-12). On Enterprise, an admin has to allow member "
"custom connectors first."
msgstr ""
"已在 Pro 上验证（2026-10-12）。在 Enterprise 中，需由管理员先允许成员使用自定"
"义连接器。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:539
msgid ""
"Back in Perplexity, the connector shows a check mark. Ask a question that "
"names it; Perplexity asks you to reply <code>yes</code> before its first "
"tool run."
msgstr ""
"回到 Perplexity，连接器会显示对勾。提出一个点名该连接器的问题；首次运行工具"
"前，Perplexity 会要求您回复 <code>yes</code>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:545
msgid ""
"Click <strong>New Connector</strong>, choose <strong>Custom</strong>, give "
"it a name and paste the link as the <strong>Server URL</strong>."
msgstr ""
"点击 <strong>New Connector</strong>，选择 <strong>Custom</strong>，输入名称并"
"将链接粘贴为 <strong>Server URL</strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:546
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Add Connector</strong> — Grok opens the sign-in in a popup."
msgstr "点击 <strong>Add Connector</strong>——Grok 会在弹出窗口中打开登录。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:547
msgid ""
"Connectors are available on every Grok plan, the free plan included "
"(verified 2026-10-12). On Business and Enterprise workspaces an admin "
"provisions the connector first."
msgstr ""
"所有 Grok 方案均可使用连接器，包括免费方案（2026-10-12 已验证）。在 Business "
"和 Enterprise 工作区中，需由管理员先配置连接器。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:548
msgid ""
"Back in Grok, the connector shows as <strong>Added</strong>. In a chat, type "
"<code>@</code> to pick it."
msgstr ""
"回到 Grok，连接器会显示为 <strong>Added</strong>。在聊天中输入 <code>@</"
"code> 即可选择它。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:552
msgid ""
"Sign in to Gemini with a <strong>personal</strong> Google account — work and "
"school accounts do not get Custom apps."
msgstr ""
"使用<strong>个人</strong> Google 账号登录 Gemini——工作和学校账号没有 Custom "
"apps 功能。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:554
msgid ""
"Open <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong>, click <strong>+ Custom</"
"strong>, paste the link as the <strong>MCP Server URL</strong> and click "
"<strong>Next</strong>. No <strong>+ Custom</strong> button? Google has not "
"turned on custom connectors for your account yet."
msgstr ""
"打开 <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong>，点击 <strong>+ Custom</"
"strong>，将链接粘贴为 <strong>MCP Server URL</strong>，然后点击 "
"<strong>Next</strong>。没有 <strong>+ Custom</strong> 按钮？说明 Google 尚未"
"为您的账号开启自定义连接器。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:555
msgid ""
"Follow Gemini’s prompts (tick the acknowledgement, <strong>Connect</strong>, "
"<strong>Agree and continue</strong>) — Gemini opens the sign-in page."
msgstr ""
"按照 Gemini 的提示操作（勾选确认框、<strong>Connect</strong>、<strong>Agree "
"and continue</strong>）——Gemini 会打开登录页面。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:556
msgid ""
"Google lists no plan requirement (verified on a Google AI Plus account). You "
"need a personal Google account in the United States, 18 or over, with Gemini "
"in English and Keep Activity on; work and school accounts do not get Custom "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"Google 未列出套餐要求（已在 Google AI Plus 账号上验证）。你需要一个美国的个"
"人 Google 账号、年满 18 岁、Gemini 使用英语并开启 Keep Activity；工作和学校账"
"号没有 Custom apps 功能。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:557
msgid ""
"Back in Gemini, click <strong>Connect</strong> on the “Save your custom app” "
"card. In a chat, type <code>@</code> to pick the app; Gemini asks you to "
"allow its first tool run."
msgstr ""
"回到 Gemini，在“Save your custom app”卡片上点击 <strong>Connect</strong>。在"
"对话中输入 <code>@</code> 选择该应用；首次运行工具时 Gemini 会请求你的允许。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:564
msgid "Or open the Muse app."
msgstr "或打开 Muse 应用。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:565
msgid ""
"Paste it into a new chat and send it. If Muse asks to contact your site, "
"allow it."
msgstr "将其粘贴到新对话中并发送。如果 Muse 请求访问你的网站，请允许。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:566
msgid ""
"Click <strong>Connect</strong> on the connector card, then <strong>Connect</"
"strong> again in the dialog — Muse opens the sign-in page in a new tab."
msgstr ""
"点击连接器卡片上的 <strong>Connect</strong>，再在对话框中点击 "
"<strong>Connect</strong>，Muse 会在新标签页中打开登录页面。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:572
msgid ""
"Meta offers Muse in the United States and Canada. Meta does not review "
"custom connectors, so add only sites you manage."
msgstr ""
"Meta 在美国和加拿大提供 Muse。Meta 不审核自定义连接器，因此只添加由你管理的网"
"站。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:573
msgid ""
"Muse asks you to approve the requests it sends to your site: <strong>Allow "
"once</strong>, <strong>Allow for this site</strong> or <strong>Always allow</"
"strong>."
msgstr ""
"Muse 会请你批准它发送到你网站的请求：<strong>Allow once</strong>、"
"<strong>Allow for this site</strong> 或 <strong>Always allow</strong>。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:575
msgid ""
"This site is behind Cloudflare: its Browser Integrity Check blocks Muse with "
"error 1010. Turn it off for <code>/wp-json/cowboy-mcp/</code>."
msgstr ""
"此网站使用了 Cloudflare：其 Browser Integrity Check 会以错误 1010 拦截 Muse。"
"请为 <code>/wp-json/cowboy-mcp/</code> 关闭该检查。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:591
msgid ""
"<strong>Grok cannot sign in to this site.</strong> It looks for sign-in "
"details only at the root of the domain, which belongs to another site here, "
"so it asks for a Client ID instead. Use another app, such as claude.ai or "
"ChatGPT."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Grok 无法登录此网站。</strong>它只在域名根目录查找登录信息，而这里的"
"根目录属于另一个网站，因此它会改为要求填写 Client ID。请改用其他应用，例如 "
"claude.ai 或 ChatGPT。"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:594
msgid ""
"<strong>Grok cannot sign in here yet.</strong> This host blocks <code>/.well-"
"known/</code>, where Grok looks for sign-in details, so it asks for a Client "
"ID instead. Let those requests through first (the Connection Doctor shows "
"the rule)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Grok 暂时无法登录此网站。</strong>此主机屏蔽了 <code>/.well-known/</"
"code>，而 Grok 正是在这里查找登录信息，因此它会改为要求填写 Client ID。请先放"
"行这些请求（Connection Doctor 会显示相应规则）。"

